95cUxQd0FIcklBX0E4YXc4QzVpTUFLdWJHRzdSY044WHVSTHVnWW9nRVlaZXZ1MFEyTFhNRzR6dU1wek5iSTV4YkxNbXBvUEV5TS1ERGlnc05ZQmY0d3F6M2V6UGNiSHNWVFh0RmJMelB6XzAxSnotZFRUblBvamNYNmFHUEFHQVpTS2ZjZGdWZml1OS1wWXc?oc=5","date":"2026-10-08","zh":"Evercore ISI 將 J.M. Smucker 目標價從 120 美元調整至 150 美元"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":3},{"name":"分析師評等","count":3}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-06-09","period":"2026-04-30","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/91419/000009141926000050/sjm-20260430.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"The Company: The J. M. Smucker Company (\"Company,\" \"registrant,\" \"we,\" \"us,\" or \"our\"), often referred to as Smucker's (a registered trademark), was established in 1897 and incorporated in Ohio in 1921. We operate principally in one industry, the manufacturing and marketing of branded food and beverage products on a worldwide basis, although the majority of our sales are in the United States (\"U.S.\"). Operations outside the U.S. are principally in Canada, although our products are exported to other countries as well. Net sales outside the U.S., subject to foreign currency translation, represented 4 percent of consolidated net sales for 2026. Our branded food and beverage products include a strong portfolio of trusted, iconic, market-leading brands that are sold to consumers primarily through retail outlets in North America.","zh":"公司：J. M. Smucker Company（「本公司」、「註冊人」、「我們」、「我們」或「我們的」），通常稱為 Smucker's（註冊商標），成立於 1897 年，並於 1921 年在俄亥俄州註冊成立。我們主要從事一個行業，即在全球範圍內製造和營銷品牌食品和飲料產品，儘管我們的大部分銷售來自美國（“美國”）。儘管我們的產品也出口到其他國家，但美國以外的業務主要在加拿大。美國境外的淨銷售額（以外幣折算）佔 2026 年合併淨銷售額的 4%。我們的品牌食品和飲料產品包括一系列值得信賴、標誌性、市場領先的品牌，主要透過北美的零售店銷售給消費者。"},{"en":"We have five reportable segments: U.S. Retail Coffee, U.S. Retail Frozen Handheld and Spreads, and U.S. Retail Pet Foods (the \"U.S. Retail reportable segments\"), Sweet Baked Snacks, and Away From Home. During the fourth quarter of 2026, the Away From Home operating segment met the reportable segment criteria under Financial Accounting Standards Board (\"FASB\") Accounting Standards Codification (\"ASC\") 280. For additional information on our reportable segments, see Note 5: Reportable Segments.","zh":"我們有五個可報告細分市場：美國零售咖啡、美國零售冷凍手持設備和塗抹醬、美國零售寵物食品（「美國零售可報告細分市場」）、甜烘焙零食和戶外用品。 2026 年第四季度，遠離家鄉的營運分部符合財務會計準則委員會（「FASB」）會計準則編纂（「ASC」）280 規定的可報告分部標準。有關我們可報告分部的更多資訊，請參閱附註 5：可報告分部。"},{"en":"On March 3, 2025, we sold certain Sweet Baked Snacks value brands to JTM Foods, LLC (\"JTM\"). The transaction included certain trademarks and licenses, a manufacturing facility in Chicago, Illinois, and approximately 400 employees who support the business. Under our ownership, these Sweet Baked Snacks value brands generated net sales of approximately $48.4 and $30.0 in 2025 and 2024, respectively, which were included in the Sweet Baked Snacks reportable segment.","zh":"2025 年 3 月 3 日，我們將某些甜烤零食價值品牌賣給 JTM Foods, LLC（「JTM」）。該交易包括某些商標和許可證、位於伊利諾伊州芝加哥的一家製造工廠以及大約 400 名支持該業務的員工。在我們的擁有下，這些甜烤零食價值品牌在 2025 年和 2024 年分別產生了約 48.4 美元和 30.0 美元的淨銷售額，其中包括在甜烤零食報告部門中。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Customers: Sales to Walmart Inc. and subsidiaries, including Sam's Club, amounted to 34 percent of net sales in 2026 and 33 percent of net sales in both 2025 and 2024. These sales are primarily included in our U.S. Retail reportable segments. No other customer exceeded 10 percent of net sales for any year.","zh":"客戶：沃爾瑪公司及其子公司（包括山姆會員店）的銷售額在 2026 年佔淨銷售額的 34%，在 2025 年和 2024 年佔淨銷售額的 33%。這些銷售額主要包含在我們的美國零售報告部門。任何一年都沒有其他客戶超過淨銷售額的 10%。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-04-30","items":[{"name":"U.S.Retail Coffee","val":3304900000,"zh":"美國零售咖啡"},{"name":"U.S.Retail Frozen Handheld & Spreads","val":1853900000,"zh":"U.S.Retail Frozen Handheld & Spreads"},{"name":"U.S.Retail Pet Foods","val":1600000000,"zh":"美國零售寵物食品"},{"name":"Sweet Baked Snacks","val":971300000,"zh":"甜烤小吃"},{"name":"Away From Home","val":879000000,"zh":"遠離家鄉"},{"name":"All Other Segments","val":441800000,"zh":"所有其他部門"}],"total":9050900000},"geo":{"end":"2026-04-30","items":[{"name":"US","val":8568200000.000001,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"International","val":482700000,"zh":"國際"},{"name":"CA","val":340800000,"zh":"加拿大"},{"name":"All Other International","val":141900000,"zh":"所有其他國際"}],"total":9050900000}},"peers":["MKC","HRL","CPB","CAG","GIS"]}}